{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-56","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the third binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line called a second bimedial.","book":10,"number":56,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.56","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.56/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":56,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","contentId":"euclid-10-56","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c8c7ec89b578170bf587fa3f60d049ad81c9e5adfe61987c05c55073c76773d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-56.statement","euclid-10-56.construction.1","euclid-10-56.construction.2","euclid-10-56.proof.1","euclid-10-56.proof.2","euclid-10-56.proof.3","euclid-10-56.proof.4","euclid-10-56.proof.5","euclid-10-56.proof.6","euclid-10-56.proof.7","euclid-10-56.conclusion","euclid-10-56.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-56.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b60de53c5f986f0ed13ffe6b00c9f06c04c8025621c9439e503120381b52ad75","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the third binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line called a second bimedial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第三个二项无理线段组成,则区域的另一边是无理线段,称为第二个双中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"40db78af2c255936dc7d246f8ca82839f088b6f2ed0ae1ffd9404212c62e5c67","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area ABCD be contained by the rational straight line AB and the third binomial AD divided into its terms at E, of which terms AE is the greater; I say that the side of the area AC is the irrational straight line called a second bimedial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABCD区由有理线段 AB组成,第三个二项无理线段 AD区分为E,其中AE为较大数量;我说,AC区是无理线段个,称为第二个双中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7217cfd7f0fec01d167e4188bde7d6bb5d9f57b4f9b48ec50785e047806a2f05","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the same construction be made as before."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的工程 和以前一样"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db10d05d7ffbcb023cec80bed27164b3abfd20d845d1257a2315e703711f5816","citations":["euclid-10-def-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AD is a third binomial straight line, therefore AE, ED are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, the square on AE is greater than the square on ED by the square on a straight line commensurable with AE, and neither of the terms AE, ED is commensurable in length with AB. [[X. Deff. II. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AD是第三条二项无理线段直线,因此AE、ED是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,AE的正方形比ED的正方形比AE的可公度直线的正方形要多,AE、ED和AB的213两个条件都比长度可公度要大。 [[X. Deff. II. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f3d43c328f8c4f0ba8e3563d22a40d014d240409a35fb0ee9220b36596422b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, in manner similar to the foregoing, we shall prove that MO is the side of the area AC, and MN, NO are medial straight lines commensurable in square only; so that MO is bimedial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,以与上述相似的方式,我们将证明MO是AC区的一侧,MN,NO是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;MO是双中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de97f3354bcd59223fc61c27ba33cdc806c89c60ad265a2d6f6ea54836811cd7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next to be proved that it is also a second bimedial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步是证明它也是第二条双中项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d999eaf3c9b7a517860248e97b1d55c84c9d2050c828855f2c627d2e6fca29a2","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since DE is incommensurable in length with AB, that is, with EK, and DE is commensurable with EF, therefore EF is incommensurable in length with EK. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于DE的长度为不可公度,AB,EK,DE,EF,EK,DE,EF,不可公度,EK。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75a4044e44b1df7666a5ef565be498e4d061fe7fcb16971e19b223f73d703e03","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are rational; therefore FE, EK are rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是有理,FE,EK,有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"643c70097df3f691dd6e89d3f3180b1ceaa511a05f57edb9ba4576918a7c08cc","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EL, that is, MR, is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EL,也就是说,MR,是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4ac75e3909de930679f99394df782b0c73e38d0428f2a955edc641716d4e9b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is contained by MN, NO; therefore the rectangle MN, NO is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由MN,NO组成, 因此矩形,MN,NO是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"246ef8b9941a33cc4ba201c56f0d90573e8c3eb960d91db21e6c86ba37c0ddf1","citations":["euclid-10-38"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MO is a second bimedial straight line. [[X. 38](/principles/euclid-10-38)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,MO是第二双中项无理线段直线,证毕。 [[X. 38](/principles/euclid-10-38)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-56.source","contentId":"euclid-10-56","revisionId":"euclid-10-56@raw-0c8c7ec89b578170","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5a29f440331e46244eefa2772a152b1a9cfb3f1dd928d907fc59867753f7f4d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.56/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.56\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-56:euclid-10-def-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-56","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-56.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-